            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.60.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 60:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co gituma ibiroranye biri kure yacu, kandi n’ukugororoka ntikudushikīra; twitega umuco tukabona umwiza; twitega ahakemutse tukagenda mu muzitanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.28.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 28:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.4.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 4:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.4.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dukabakaba ku nzu nk’impumyi, ni koko dukabakaba nk’abatagira amaso; ku murango w’amashōka dutsitara nko mu kajoro; mu bagikomeye tumeze nk’abapfuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.38.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 38:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.46.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "46:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twese twivuga nk’igikōko citwa idubu, tukaniha nk’inuma iguguza; twitega ibiroranye, ariko nta vyo; twitega agakiza, ariko kakaba kure yacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw ibicumuro vyacu vyagwiriranye imbere yawe, kand’ ivyaha vyacu ari vyo bitwagiriza: kukw ibicumuro vyacu turi kumwe, kandi n’ibigabitanyo vyacu na vyo turabizi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "turacumura kandi twihakana Uhoraho, duta inzira tukareka gukurikira Imana yacu, tukavuga ivy’ agahahazo n’ubugarariji; dusama inda y’ ibinyoma, tukabivuga biturutse mu mutima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibiroranye vyashubijwe inyuma, n’ukugororoka guhagaze kure; kuk’ ukuri kwatemvye mu nzira, kand’ ubgeranda ntibushobora gushika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
